--- the case an earlier version of this guard MISSED ---
  With BetterCAD-build also present, bettercad-aaa's own short name is
  BETTER~2, not BETTER~1. A guard that required an equal short name would
  have passed this configure, and the build would then have failed at
  deployment. The guard keys on name order instead.
